      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 2722692516,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Showing `[UNVERIFIED]` in the Info column for every MACsec packet even though no configuration for decoding MACsec is installed, seems a bit harsh.\n\nIf no config is present, the `[UNVERIFIED` will not be added; thus, it is backwards compatible to 4.4.",
